---
// Hero section focused on outcomes, simplification, and practical training
---

<section class="relative pt-10 pb-14 overflow-hidden bg-white" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ah8lbk">
  <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:iy4tah">
    <!-- Main Headline & Copy - First Text in Section -->
    <div class="max-w-[980px] mx-auto text-center" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgf9">
      <h1 class="font-bold leading-[1.12] mb-6 tracking-tight text-[#243D5D] text-[34px] sm:text-[46px] lg:text-[54px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:307k1n">We Simplified the Tax Sale Research Process  So You Can Find the Few Deals Worth Bidding On</h1>

      <p class="text-[17px] sm:text-[20px] text-[#243D5D] leading-relaxed max-w-[860px] mx-auto mb-8 font-normal" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:6uykn5">
Tax defaulted property investing is simple, but it is not easy. This is not a quick hit. This business rewards people who learn the process and keep improving. That’s why Ted Thomas created the Magic Map™ System, combining nationwide auction data from trusted research partner Tax Sale Resources with AI-assisted filtering so you are not left alone to figure out the software.
</p>

      <!-- Key Value Pillars -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-[900px] mx-auto mb-9 text-left" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgf6">
        <div class="bg-[#F8FAFD] border border-[#E2EDF8] rounded-xl p-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgf7">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgf8">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#F37424] shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.26 10.147a60.436 60.436 0 00-.491 6.347A48.627 48.627 0 0112 20.904a48.627 48.627 0 018.232-4.41 60.46 60.46 0 00-.491-6.347m-15.482 0a50.57 50.57 0 00-2.658-.813A59.905 59.905 0 0112 3.493a59.902 59.902 0 0110.399 5.84c-.896.248-1.783.52-2.658.814m-15.482 0A50.697 50.697 0 0112 13.489a50.702 50.702 0 017.74-3.342M6.75 15a.75.75 0 100-1.5.75.75 0 000 1.5zm0 0v-3.675A55.378 55.378 0 0112 8.443m-7.007 11.55A5.981 5.981 0 006.75 15.75v-1.5" />
            </svg>
            <span class="font-bold text-[#243D5D] text-[15px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:z1i1wh">AI Assisted Filtering Tutorials</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-[#5A7184] leading-normal" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ijv6zj">Nobody else gives these classes. We show you how to use AI to download and upload county lists and filter down to top deals using Ted's custom AI workflow.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8FAFD] border border-[#E2EDF8] rounded-xl p-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgf9">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgfa">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#006AAE] shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H8.25m0 12.75h7.5m-7.5 3H12M10.5 2.25H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 00-9-9z" />
            </svg>
            <span class="font-bold text-[#243D5D] text-[15px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:z1i1wg">500 Search Capacity</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-[#5A7184] leading-normal" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ijv6zi">Not more homework. The capacity to thoroughly filter large lists to find the few profitable properties to match your budget and your goals.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8FAFD] border border-[#E2EDF8] rounded-xl p-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgfb">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgfc">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#10B981] shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-7.5 6l2.25 2.25 4.5-5.25M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
            <span class="font-bold text-[#243D5D] text-[15px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:z1i1wf">No Technical Skill Needed</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-[#5A7184] leading-normal" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ijv6zh">You don't need to be a programmer. Ted's trusted partner provides verified data, and we teach you the simple steps to speed up your research.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA Button & Guarantee -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 mb-10" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgfa">
        <a
          href="#pricing"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#F37424] hover:bg-[#E06313] text-white text-[16px] sm:text-[18px] font-semibold px-9 py-4 rounded-full transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] shadow-md tracking-[0.5px]"
         data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:8zc1z">Get The Magic Map™ System</a>
        <p class="text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] text-[#5A7184] italic" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:6uykn4">Includes full research software access, 500 property reports, and training on AI filtering.</p>
        <div class="pt-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgfb">
          <img
            src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/7723170b/images/617c85158d0b9e6b6ac27e4b_users-c20a54-319.webp"
            alt="Tax Sale Resources and Ted Thomas Students"
            class="h-8 sm:h-9 w-auto object-contain mx-auto"
            width="319"
            height="71" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:gfvoyy" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- App Interface Screen Preview -->
      <div class="relative max-w-[1040px] mx-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#D1D5DB] shadow-xl bg-white aspect-[16/10]" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgfc">
        <img
          src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/7723170b/images/62b5f96c583276885c002551_Advanced-Search-bf7c48-1024.webp"
          alt="Ted Thomas Magic Map Application Search & Map View"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:gfvoyz" />
      </div>

      <!-- Partner Trust Positioning Card -->
      <div class="max-w-[860px] mx-auto mt-8 bg-[#FAFCFF] rounded-2xl border border-[#E2EDF8] shadow-xs p-4 sm:p-5" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgf3">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-6 text-center sm:text-left" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgf4">
          <div class="shrink-0" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgf5">
            <img
              src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/7723170b/images/fb-logo-320.webp"
              alt="Ted Thomas Exclusive"
              class="h-9 w-auto object-contain md:max-w-[300px] md:h-[108px]"
              width="140"
              height="40" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:gfvoyw" />
          </div>
          <div class="hidden sm:block w-px h-10 bg-[#CDCDD2]" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgf6"></div>
          <div class="flex-1 space-y-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgf7">
            <p class="text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] text-[#243D5D] font-normal" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:6uykns">
              Ted Thomas brings in trusted research partners so students get better data, better tools, and better training in one place.
            </p>
            <p class="text-[13px] sm:text-[14px] text-[#243D5D] font-bold" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:6uykn6">
              🔒 <em>Tax Sale Resources is a trusted research partner of Ted Thomas.</em>
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2 pt-0.5" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:ecxgf8">
              <span class="text-[12px] sm:text-[13px] text-[#5A7184] italic" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:z1i1xc">5-Star Research Partner</span>
              <img
                src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/7723170b/images/617b2fc6601e943726b6d873_Group-30-1-738f89-207.webp"
                alt="Tax Sale Resources 5-Star Rating"
                class="h-4 w-auto object-contain"
                width="207"
                height="39" data-ps="src/components/home/Hero.astro:gfvoyx" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
